  "label": "Misogyny: Objectification/Body Part Focus",
  "description": "The meme's explicit focus on a specific, vulgar bodily part ('nuts') as the target of violence is a form of objectification. This relies on misogynistic tropes that reduce women to their bodies and sexualize their physical features. The meme uses this trope to demean Michelle Obama by focusing on her body as a target for degradation, reinforcing the idea that women are objects to be controlled or assaulted.",
